+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2GR10VD68PDWMQF48K8PYAC","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S6"],"title":"V1 Encoding and Sanitization: no injection sinks in the db-models library","description":"ASVS 5.0 L1 scope (isolated dev, internal; the metastore marks some fields pii/spdi). The library has no entry points: no HTTP routes, CLI, __main__, queue consumers or jobs. Its only database access is three mongoengine queries: Entity.objects(id=self.insight_entity_id) at models.py:285, Entity.objects(id=self.purchased_instrument) at 363-365 and Entity.objects(id=self.notif_entity_mentioned) at 459-463. Each passes a field value that is already a string, DBRef or ReferenceField as a keyword argument. There is no __raw__, $where, raw pymongo, filter built from a request dict, template rendering, shell call, XML parser or HTML output, so a query operator cannot be injected from inside the library. Callers of these models (not in this checkout) can still build unsafe queries; that is outside this repo. Reviewed at 70b3633e171a1b8d389b27bb901c84c34a0e9bf6. SARIF has a pass result for asvs-v1-nosql-injection. No scanner ran because no executor is configured.","methods":["execute-scr"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-14T19:35:56Z","result":"satisfied","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/d39b9417-293b-4271-b6af-ce77f681e83f/execute-scr.db-models.onfinance-db-model-master.sarif.export.json","sha256":"46a0a2106e529443f3fb1eef74299488a7b4aa6cc106ca490d095a35e5bec8a2"},"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py","sha256":"7f6eb5d6f2beb71e698ada8a80adaee08fb316afe8d9ed3c25238e33ba46b553","collectedAt":"2026-09-14T19:40:03Z","description":"read in full (lines 1-500) at 70b3