+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2GR10YTBW869402MWCQPP2Z","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S4","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(a)"],"title":"V14 Data Protection: serialisers expose no PII, but credentials and chat content are stored unprotected","description":"ASVS 5.0 L1 scope. The dict serialisers expose no customer PII:\n- Insights.fetch_insights_as_dict (237-281) and fetch_insights_as_dict_full (283-329) return market content plus a bookmark flag.\n- Holdings.process_holding_as_dict (360-379) returns platform, price, quantity and entity metadata, with no user identifiers.\n- Notifications.fetch_notif_as_dict (441-477) returns notification content only.\nNone of them serialises the User document, and none returns email, phone, full name or credentials. The gaps:\n- Broker and exchange credentials are stored with no protection (SCH-PII-02, models.py:8-15 and 397).\n- Free-text LLM chat prompts and messages are persisted with no retention or masking: User.user_chats (424), the Chat model (381-385) and CachedChats (498-500, which has no user binding). These may carry personal data.\nRetention and consent gaps on User are already in the ledger from probe-schemas (fnd_01M2GMN62KVM9J9R852X3E3ST7, fnd_01M2GMN63DEDR29P66QTKND8E7) and are not repeated here.","methods":["execute-scr"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-14T19:35:56Z","result":"partial","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/d39b9417-293b-4271-b6af-ce77f681e83f/execute-scr.db-models.onfinance-db-model-master.sarif.export.json","sha256":"46a0a2106e529443f3fb1eef74299488a7b4aa6cc106ca490d095a35e5bec8a2"},"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py","sha256":"7f6eb5d6f2beb71e698ada8a80adaee08fb316afe8d9ed3c25238e33b