+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2GR10ZN8XF7CRAWK2C2EK5Q","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.MA.S3"],"title":"V15 Secure Coding and Architecture: no unsafe deserialisation; dependency vulnerability status inconclusive without a scanner DB","description":"ASVS 5.0 L1 scope. models.py contains no pickle, yaml.load, eval, exec, subprocess or dynamic import. The two re.search patterns at 240 and 244 are fixed and cannot backtrack catastrophically. SARIF has a pass result for asvs-v15-insecure-deserialisation.\n\nDependencies: setup.py pins mongoengine==0.24.1 (line 19). It declares no pymongo pin, and the repo has no lockfile or hash-locked requirements, so the transitive pymongo version is resolved at install time. That conflicts with policy dependencyPolicy.lockfilesRequired=true, which belongs to the probe-sdlc lane.\n\nThe vulnerability status of mongoengine 0.24.1 and its transitive pymongo could not be checked. trivy and grype need a cached DB, and scan.mjs reported no-executor. Network lookups are out of scope for this agent, so no CVE is asserted.","methods":["execute-scr"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-14T19:35:56Z","result":"inconclusive","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/d39b9417-293b-4271-b6af-ce77f681e83f/execute-scr.db-models.onfinance-db-model-master.sarif.export.json","sha256":"46a0a2106e529443f3fb1eef74299488a7b4aa6cc106ca490d095a35e5bec8a2"},"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/setup.py","sha256":"13c1e68d74d84cd7be239cc2dafec49aebf52c31f4f5048794609cd71d2c11d6","collectedAt":"2026-09-14T19:40:03Z","description":"install_requires mongoengine==0.24.1 at line 19"},{"type":"command-output","ref":"node .claude/scripts/toolchain/scan.mjs --company example-co --app db-models -